@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Contact

DEVELOPER OWNER: Tariq
MODULE: Public Site
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Contact form; ContactController currently answers 501 so
nothing is claimed as sent.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Anonymous

ROUTE: /contact

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Decide whether inquiries are stored (no table in the
  approved schema) or emailed.

DEPENDENCIES:
ContactController, contact.js.

STATUS:
PAGE FROM THE SUPPLIED LAYOUT ZIP — STATIC CONTENT, NO BUSINESS LOGIC.

IMPORTANT:
No dedicated Trello card — part of Tariq’s public site.
